---
title: "publishTgeDetails (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: onlyLegion
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenNotPaused
    q_guard2 --> q_guard3: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard3 --> q_guard4: whenSaleEnded
    q_guard4 --> q_guard5: whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guard5 --> q_setToken: s_saleConfig.askToken = askToken
    q_setToken --> q_setPrice: s_saleConfig.tokenPrice = tokenPrice
    q_setPrice --> q_setDecimals: s_saleConfig.askTokenDecimals = askTokenDecimals
    q_setDecimals --> q_emit: emit TgeDetailsPublished(askToken, tokenPrice, askTokenDecimals)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_guard5
        INV-001: TGE details published after refund period - committed state
        INV-002: askToken address set here for pre-TGE sales (token may not exist at sale start)
    end note

    note right of q_setPrice
        INV-003: tokenPrice used to calculate claim allocations
        INV-004: Only Legion can publish TGE details (centralized trust)
    end note
